# A token copy of Jace, the Mind Sculptor is a Jace planeswalker token (it keeps its printed 3 loyalty). Bot2 casts the Mind
# Sculptor on turn 2; on turn 3 Bot1's Fractured Identity exiles it and Bot1 gets the copy. Bot1 then plays Theorist's Sanctum, which
# beholds that copy (a permanent: chosen, not revealed), so it enters untapped. On turn 5 empower Jace has a Jace planeswalker
# token already, the copy, so it makes no new token and puts the two counters on the copy (5); with a single token nothing is asked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Fractured Identity
Theorist's Sanctum
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Jace, the Mind Sculptor
Island x3
Island x14

